==Description==
The '''Beach Crate''' is a seasonal crate that was released for the Summer of 2026. This crate yields 16 beach-themed skins. It can be purchased for {{Coins|4,500}} in the store, or for {{Robux|199}}.

Each skin that can be obtained from the '''Beach Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the Daily Skin Store. In the Daily Skin Store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Coins|4,500}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins cost {{Coins|5,250}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|6,500}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|10,000}}.

==Appearance==
The '''Beach Crate''' is a blue and white colored crate designed to resemble a cooler. It has multiple stickers on it in addition to the Paradoxum Games logo on top of it.

==Methods of Obtaining==
